# Citation metadata for the analysis code. GitHub shows it as "Cite this repository", and
# Zenodo reads it when archiving a GitHub release.
# TODO before the first release: set version and date-released, and add the article DOI to
# preferred-citation once issued. The Zenodo DOI is added after Zenodo mints it.
cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the article below and this software release."
type: software
title: "sensorimotor-communication: analysis code for Dynamic engagement of long-range communication across sensorimotor cortex during flexible behavior"
abstract: >-
  MATLAB code producing every figure panel of Blaeser, Clough, Ahrens and Chen (Nature
  Communications): population decoding, inter-areal communication subspaces from canonical
  correlation analysis, an information flow index, and in-silico silencing of
  projection-labelled neurons, together with the lab code used to preprocess the two-photon
  imaging and to track whiskers. The data are published separately on G-Node GIN.
